[PASS] relay_tx returned code -27 ≠ -7 — PHASE A CONFIRMED (bypass).

[PASS] wallet_a tx_key: 2659d5e7ca45e83a5606c52a49aa3c9cb4c98eaa6f1d74b42fb6569825cd7206
[PASS] relay_tx SUCCEEDED on restricted wallet_b.

BEFORE: 200 outputs — 0 spent, 200 unspent
AFTER : 200 outputs — 2 SPENT (frozen), 198 unspent
[PASS] *** OUTPUT FREEZE CONFIRMED ***

tx_key (wallet_a, attacker) : 2659d5e7ca45e83a5606c52a49aa3c9cb4c98eaa6f1d74b42fb6569825cd7206
tx_key (wallet_b, victim)   : 2659d5e7ca45e83a5606c52a49aa3c9cb4c98eaa6f1d74b42fb6569825cd7206
